From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: @rezoss_reza <rezoss79@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 30 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Force Now Nudge receiver

Force SuggestedRepliesReceiver registration and bypass the now_nudge_enabled
settings check on S23U One UI 9. Also bypass the Now Nudge settings check in
SuggestedRepliesViewModel.isShowExpandButton() (upstream ViewModel hunk),
keeping its N0 capability guard. Keep the service-alive guard and receiver
payload validation intact.

---
diff --git a/smali_classes2/I6/b.smali b/smali_classes2/I6/b.smali
--- a/smali_classes2/I6/b.smali
+++ b/smali_classes2/I6/b.smali
@@ -278,7 +278,7 @@
     :cond_1
     sget-boolean p0, LN8/a;->K:Z
 
-    if-nez p0, :cond_2
+    goto :cond_2
 
     sget-boolean p0, LN8/a;->I:Z
 
diff --git a/smali_classes2/com/samsung/android/honeyboard/base/suggestedreplies/receiver/SuggestedRepliesReceiver.smali b/smali_classes2/com/samsung/android/honeyboard/base/suggestedreplies/receiver/SuggestedRepliesReceiver.smali
--- a/smali_classes2/com/samsung/android/honeyboard/base/suggestedreplies/receiver/SuggestedRepliesReceiver.smali
+++ b/smali_classes2/com/samsung/android/honeyboard/base/suggestedreplies/receiver/SuggestedRepliesReceiver.smali
@@ -823,7 +823,7 @@
 
     move-result v2
 
-    if-ne v2, v14, :cond_16
+    nop
 
     invoke-virtual {v0, v13}, Landroid/content/Intent;->getStringExtra(Ljava/lang/String;)Ljava/lang/String;
 
diff --git a/smali_classes2/com/samsung/android/honeyboard/textboard/suggestedreplies/viewmodel/SuggestedRepliesViewModel.smali b/smali_classes2/com/samsung/android/honeyboard/textboard/suggestedreplies/viewmodel/SuggestedRepliesViewModel.smali
--- a/smali_classes2/com/samsung/android/honeyboard/textboard/suggestedreplies/viewmodel/SuggestedRepliesViewModel.smali
+++ b/smali_classes2/com/samsung/android/honeyboard/textboard/suggestedreplies/viewmodel/SuggestedRepliesViewModel.smali
@@ -381,6 +381,8 @@
     return v2
 
     :cond_1
+    return v2
+
     iget-object p0, p0, Lcom/samsung/android/honeyboard/textboard/suggestedreplies/viewmodel/SuggestedRepliesViewModel;->suggestedRepliesContext:Lwq/a;
 
     check-cast p0, Lse/c;
-- 
